{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/leading-the-platform-team-bench/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"1e5da22d-4600-5096-b6b3-3597bd021b53","html":"<p><em>This post was originally published on <a href=\"https://medium.com/lifeatbench/leading-the-platform-team-bench-f5d51ee9c540\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Bench’s engineering blog</a> while I was a Principal Engineer at Bench.</em></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/d165a/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 66.66666666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/8ac56/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.webp 240w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/d3be9/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.webp 480w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/e46b2/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.webp 960w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/7f403/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.webp 1400w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/09b79/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg 240w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/7cc5e/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg 480w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/6a068/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg 960w,\n/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/d165a/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg 1400w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/4544559343e3aeb8699c85f9b2bcf29f/6a068/leading-the-platform-team-bench--0-jENUoBjBn_c3Z4K5.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Photo by Clément H on Unsplash\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><em>Photo by Clément H on Unsplash</em></p>\n<p>For just over two years I have lead the Platform Team at Bench. The work we’ve done is definitely a highlight of my career. This includes…</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/starting-out-with-kubernetes-why-we-rolled-our-own-despite-the-naysayers\">Building our own Kubernetes, understanding its nuts and bolts and migrating all our services over from AWS ElasticBeanstalk</a></li>\n<li>Chaos testing, every Wednesday (for a while)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/ephemeral-database-credentials\">Rolling out ephemeral database credentials with HashiCorp Vault for all our apps and engineers and talking about it HashiConf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/from-activemq-to-amazon-mq-why-and-how-we-moved-to-awss-managed-solution\">Migrating our infrastructure and services to Amazon MQ</a> and being a <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">featured customer on the Amazon MQ homepage</a></li>\n<li>Terraforming all the things!</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://medium.com/lifeatbench/cloud-native-jenkins-on-aws-6d58d4b1d3ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Rebuilding our Jenkins infrastructure to be… well.. rebuildable</a></li>\n<li>Rolling out Dex for Kubernetes authentication with Okta via OIDC</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y0SdwZDy20Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n<p><strong>Next up</strong></p>\n<p>This quarter we’re moving all our Kubernetes clusters over to AWS EKS, instead of continuing to roll our own with <a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/kops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Kops</a>. 49 services across 3 environments will seamlessly migrate across to EKS, just as they did when we moved off of ElasticBeanstalk without downtime.</p>\n<p><strong>Passing the reins</strong></p>\n<p>My role with the Platform Team has changed as I have morphed into my new role as Principal Software Engineer (still at Bench). Right now I’m still guiding the work, but I’m looking for someone else to take the reins and work with me to keep pushing infrastructure at Bench forward as I become more involved across the wider Engineering team. There’s so much more to do!</p>\n<style class=\"grvsc-styles\">\n  .grvsc-container {\n    overflow: auto;\n    position: relative;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    padding-top: var(--grvsc-padding-top, var(--grvsc-padding-v, 1rem));\n    padding-bottom: 1rem;\n    padding-bottom: var(--grvsc-padding-bottom, var(--grvsc-padding-v, 1rem));\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-radius: var(--grvsc-border-radius, 8px);\n    font-feature-settings: normal;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-code {\n    display: table;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-line {\n    display: table-row;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-line > * {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-gutter-pad {\n    display: table-cell;\n    padding-left: 0.75rem;\n    padding-left: calc(var(--grvsc-padding-left, var(--grvsc-padding-h, 1.5rem)) / 2);\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-gutter {\n    display: table-cell;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n    -moz-user-select: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-gutter::before {\n    content: attr(data-content);\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-source {\n    display: table-cell;\n    padding-left: 1.5rem;\n    padding-left: var(--grvsc-padding-left, var(--grvsc-padding-h, 1.5rem));\n    padding-right: 1.5rem;\n    padding-right: var(--grvsc-padding-right, var(--grvsc-padding-h, 1.5rem));\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-source:empty::after {\n    content: ' ';\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n    -moz-user-select: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-gutter + .grvsc-source {\n    padding-left: 0.75rem;\n    padding-left: calc(var(--grvsc-padding-left, var(--grvsc-padding-h, 1.5rem)) / 2);\n  }\n  \n  /* Line transformer styles */\n  \n  .grvsc-has-line-highlighting > .grvsc-code > .grvsc-line::before {\n    content: ' ';\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-line-diff-add::before {\n    background-color: var(--grvsc-line-diff-add-background-color, rgba(0, 255, 60, 0.2));\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-line-diff-del::before {\n    background-color: var(--grvsc-line-diff-del-background-color, rgba(255, 0, 20, 0.2));\n  }\n  \n  .grvsc-line-number {\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    text-align: right;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n  \n</style>","fields":{"slug":"/leading-the-platform-team-bench"},"frontmatter":{"date":"2019-10-11T00:00:00-08:00","description":"For just over two years I have lead the Platform Team at Bench. The work we’ve done is definitely a highlight of my career.","title":"Leading The Platform Team @ Bench","socialImage":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/leading-the-platform-team-bench"}},"staticQueryHashes":["459988677"],"slicesMap":{}}